    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This chitinous breastplate of alien tendon, shell, and pulsating muscle grafts directly to your ribs and torso upon investment. It acts as a <em>+1 resilient breastplate</em>. The breastplate constantly filters your bodily fluids, granting you a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saving throws against poisons and diseases, and you recover 5 Hit Points every 10 minutes. However, the living breastplate demands vitality: during your daily preparations, it drains vital humors, requiring you to consume double your normal rations or suffer its gnawing hunger.</p>"
